            { "text": "機能が利用可能になった後も、ユーザー自身のオプトインが必要", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified", "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/microsoftteams/rooms/voice-and-face-recognition", "locator": "手順 2: 登録設定を管理する", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-18T21:40:00Z" }] }
